---

<!-- 4. THE CLIENT EXPERIENCE: YOU FOCUS ON / WE COORDINATE -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 flex flex-col gap-10">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-center items-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-primary text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">
      Your Experience
    </div>
    
    <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-on-surface max-w-xl">
      You Shouldn't Have To Manage A Construction Site.
    </h2>
    
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-lg leading-relaxed">
      We absorb the friction, paperwork, daily trade scheduling, and quality auditing so your building journey remains calm, predictable, and inspiring.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
    <!-- YOU FOCUS ON -->
    <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 shadow-xs">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-on-surface">
            YOU FOCUS ON
          </h3>
        </div>

        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Defining your architectural lifestyle ambitions and aesthetic vision</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Curating luxury surface materials, natural stone slabs, and finishes</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Reviewing clear milestone deliverables and video progress recaps</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Anticipating move-in celebration with complete peace of mind</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- WE COORDINATE -->
    <div class="bg-[#071A33] text-on-primary p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-white">
            WE COORDINATE
          </h3>
        </div>

        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-surface-container-high">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Statutory municipal sanctions, zoning submissions, and legal bylaws</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Multidisciplinary trade synchronization, on-site supervision, and daily logs</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Global supply-chain material imports, batch testing, and lead-time schedules</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Laser-measured structural tolerances, pressure diagnostics, and QA sign-offs</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="text-center pt-2">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-primary font-headline">
      Your Project · Our Responsibility
    </span>
  </div>
</section>
